# The programs of the program box, as the person at the machine runs them
# (design 8.7), for tools/ui_run.py on a kernel built with UITEST=1: each
# started as a double press on its link starts it (an accessory) or with
# its template (a program that edits a document), its window looked for;
# then a wallpaper chosen and placed in システム環境設定 and a backup
# saved to /boot and restored from there; and last, that the kernel told
# of no call refused for want of a right ("!OACV!"). The programs of
# the packages of etc/pkg (PCM Player, MPEG Player) are among them.
# シリアル通信 is left out: it takes the second serial port this test is
# driven through; so is ブラウザ, which has its own tests, and 歯車,
# which needs GL=1. The editing, saving and printing of each program
# are in its own steps (ui_calc, ui_mcard, ...), which end the same way.
#
# accessories and settings
open 01a0d8c4-5212-7a19-8d63-e04b5c9f2a71
waitwin 時計 60
open 01a0d8c4-5219-7c3e-8a41-2f6b9d0e5c11
waitwin コンソール 60
open 01a0d8c4-5320-7a41-8b52-6c7d8e9fa020
waitwin 電卓 60
open 01a0d8c4-5350-7a61-8d72-9fab0c1d5050
waitwin 文字検索 60
open 01a0d8c4-5312-7c23-8d34-5e6f7b8c9d12
waitwin 単語登録 60
open 01a0d8c4-52e8-7b19-9c2a-3d4e5f6a7b84
waitwin キー配列 60
open 01a0d8c4-52b5-7a41-8c61-2d7e9f0a1b31
waitwin ネットワーク設定 60
open 01a0d8c4-52b7-7c63-8e83-4f9a012c3d53
waitwin ユーザ環境設定 60
shot ua_accessories
# programs with their templates
open a22ca516-a22c-7fdb-81fd-04cda3e1c8af
waitwin マイクロスクリプト 60
open 019d6f00-1a2b-7c3d-8e4f-a1b2c3d4e5f6
waitwin 予定表 60
open 019b54a4-6ccf-72f7-e320-c98e4a0bab4e
waitwin 基本表計算 60
open 019c403c-bb89-7133-acc4-ddd109fb8182
waitwin かな入力練習 60
open 01a0d8c4-5334-7e95-8a06-b1c2d3e4f534
waitwin カード用紙 60
open 01a0d8c4-5372-7c93-8aa4-bc1d2e3f7272
waitwin 空書庫 60
open 01a0d8c4-53c4-7e55-8f66-7a8b9cad53c4
waitwin 手帳用紙（予定表） 60
open 01a0f5f6-b195-7135-9e60-3b5ea8ea47c8
waitwin PCM Player 60
open 01a0f638-4c5d-767a-9436-fd682491cbe7
waitwin MPEG Player 60
shot ua_documents
# システム環境設定: 画面, 背景, the wallpaper TESSRON chosen and placed in the middle.
# With some twenty programs running, each polling and calling the system
# every 20 ms, a program that starts now takes a minute or more on TCG
# before it has filled its panel: what is pressed before it says it is
# ready goes to parts with nothing in them. So the presses wait for that.
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
waitwin システム環境設定 60
expectin 240 sysenv: ready
click 235 124
wait 1000
click 230 185
wait 1500
click 410 520
expect settings: the machine's were written
wait 1000
shot ua_wallpaper
# バックアップ: 仮身サンプル chosen and saved to the boot disk, then read back from there
open 01a0d8c4-52b0-7d15-9a3c-4e6f8b2d1c07
waitwin バックアップ 60
expectin 240 backup: ready
# the panel's list: 仮身サンプル chosen, 〈選ぶ〉 marks it, 〈保存〉 saves it
click 300 257
wait 300
click 470 431
wait 300
click 644 505
expectin 120 backup: saved 61 objects in 1 volumes
wait 1000
# the 復帰 tab, the first volume's head read with 〈復帰〉, and restored with it again
click 237 165
wait 2000
click 644 505
wait 1500
shot ua_volume
click 644 505
wait 15000
expectin 120 backup: restored
wait 1000
shot ua_backup
wins
# nothing any of them did was refused for want of a right
absent !OACV!
